{"created_at":"1794858946","description":"Split a total amount in euro across N participants so the parts add up to the total exactly. For 1000.00 EUR across 3 participants each base share is 333.33 EUR and the remaining 0.01 EUR goes to exactly one participant.","id":"SPEC-bill-split","level":"product","slug":"product/bill-split","status":"draft","title":"Bill split","type":"spec","updated_at":"1794858946"}
{"created_at":"1794858946","description":"Euro amounts are represented as integer minor units (cents, i64) everywhere in the split pipeline. Binary floating point is not part of the domain model.","id":"SPEC-eur-minor-units","level":"foundation","slug":"foundation/domain/model/eur-minor-units","status":"draft","title":"EUR minor units","type":"spec","updated_at":"1794858946"}
{"created_at":"1794858946","description":"When an amount does not divide evenly across participants, leftover minor units are assigned to participants by an explicit, seeded policy. The policy is an input, not hidden randomness, so the same request can be replayed and verified.","id":"SPEC-remainder-assignment","level":"component","slug":"component/remainder-assignment","status":"draft","title":"Remainder assignment","type":"spec","updated_at":"1794858946"}
{"created_at":"1794859024","id":"AC-eur-format-roundtrip","intent":"Formatting integer cents produces a two-decimal euro string and parsing that string returns the same integer cents.","review_mode":"automated","risk_level":"medium","slug":"eur-format-roundtrip","spec_id":"SPEC-eur-minor-units","title":"Cents formatting roundtrips","type":"acceptance_criterion","updated_at":"1794859024"}
{"created_at":"1794859024","id":"AC-eur-parses-decimal-to-cents","intent":"Decimal strings such as 1000.00, 333.33 and 0.01 parse to the exact integer cents 100000, 33333 and 1 without binary floating point arithmetic.","review_mode":"automated","risk_level":"high","slug":"eur-parses-decimal-to-cents","spec_id":"SPEC-eur-minor-units","title":"Parses euro decimals into integer cents","type":"acceptance_criterion","updated_at":"1794859024"}
{"created_at":"1794859024","id":"AC-eur-rejects-sub-cent-amounts","intent":"Amounts with more than two fractional digits, such as 1000.001, are rejected instead of being rounded silently.","review_mode":"automated","risk_level":"high","slug":"eur-rejects-sub-cent-amounts","spec_id":"SPEC-eur-minor-units","title":"Rejects sub-cent amounts","type":"acceptance_criterion","updated_at":"1794859024"}
{"created_at":"1794859024","id":"AC-remainder-one-cent-per-participant","intent":"When the total does not divide evenly, the remainder is at most N-1 cents and it is distributed as one extra cent per chosen participant, never two on the same participant.","review_mode":"automated","risk_level":"high","slug":"remainder-one-cent-per-participant","spec_id":"SPEC-remainder-assignment","title":"At most one extra cent per participant","type":"acceptance_criterion","updated_at":"1794859024"}
{"created_at":"1794859024","id":"AC-remainder-seeded-choice-reproducible","intent":"For the same total, participant count and seed, the remainder recipients and allocation order are identical across runs; different seeds can select different recipients.","review_mode":"automated","risk_level":"high","slug":"remainder-seeded-choice-reproducible","spec_id":"SPEC-remainder-assignment","title":"Seeded choice is reproducible","type":"acceptance_criterion","updated_at":"1794859024"}
{"created_at":"1794858960","id":"AC-split-1000-across-3","intent":"Splitting 1000.00 EUR across 3 participants yields shares 333.33, 333.33 and 333.34 EUR in some order; the sum is exactly 1000.00 EUR.","review_mode":"automated","risk_level":"high","slug":"split-1000-across-3","spec_id":"SPEC-bill-split","title":"Split 1000 EUR across 3 participants","type":"acceptance_criterion","updated_at":"1794858960"}
{"created_at":"1794859024","id":"AC-split-equal-division-has-no-remainder","intent":"Splitting 999.99 EUR across 3 participants yields 333.33 EUR for each participant and a remainder of zero cents.","review_mode":"automated","risk_level":"high","slug":"split-equal-division-has-no-remainder","spec_id":"SPEC-bill-split","title":"Equal division has no remainder","type":"acceptance_criterion","updated_at":"1794859024"}
{"created_at":"1794859024","id":"AC-split-rejects-zero-participants","intent":"A split request with zero participants is rejected with a typed error and no allocation is produced.","review_mode":"automated","risk_level":"medium","slug":"split-rejects-zero-participants","spec_id":"SPEC-bill-split","title":"Rejects zero participants","type":"acceptance_criterion","updated_at":"1794859024"}
{"created_at":"1794859024","id":"AC-split-total-preserved","intent":"For any accepted total in cents and any positive participant count, the sum of all allocations equals the requested total exactly.","review_mode":"automated","risk_level":"high","slug":"split-total-preserved","spec_id":"SPEC-bill-split","title":"Total is preserved","type":"acceptance_criterion","updated_at":"1794859024"}
